The major downside of magicbane is that its damage is not
very good for the late game.  This, of course, really only
matters if you plan to do significant melee.  (Getting it
up to +7 makes it better than most non-artifact weapons,
so it's not a _bad_ weapon.  It's just not _great_.)

If you're planning to do a lot of throwing of +7 daggers,
Magicbane is a reasonable choice, especially for chaotic
characters (who have trouble getting slotless MR).

